  "How does Nepos show Hannibal's loyalty to Antiochus despite the king's mistakes?",
  "\"propius Tiberi quam in Thermopylis\": how does Nepos use geography to make his point about what might have been?",
  "Nepos reports two versions of Mago's death and does not choose between them. What does this suggest about him as a biographer?"
